The '''Bothan Run'''<ref name="Guide">{{SWYouTube|series=Star Wars: Galaxy Guide|text=Meet the Hutts: The Galaxy's Biggest Crime Lords|video=Ct977noXUVg}}</ref> was a [[hyperspace route]] that ran through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], running from [[Daalang]] to [[Bothawui]] in [[Bothan Space]]. The route was the continuation<ref name="Map" /> of the [[Trax Tube]],<ref name="Trax" /> which ended at Daalang where it met<ref name="Map" /> the [[Gamor Run]],<ref name="Gamor" /> and ended at Bothawui which sat at the nexus of multiple [[hyperspace route]]s as well. [[Demiloch]], [[Lannik]], [[Crul]], and [[Moonus Mandel]] were situated along the route between Daalang to the north and Bothawui to the south.<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Bothan Run]], and originated in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

